'''Gentle Mates''' is a [[:Category:France|French]] esports organization. 

On April 13<sup>th</sup>, 2023, Gentle Mates was formed. The team previously existed as ''{{Abbr|SBG|Squeezie, Brawks, Gotaga}}'' but rebranded following the Gentle Mates brand launch. <ref name="Gentle Mates formed">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/gentlemates/status/1646562429042556964|title=Tout commence ici ...|trans_title=It all starts here...|language={{Flag|fr}} French|date=2023-04-13|author='''Gentle Mates'''}}</ref>

